      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# CAUCE 73 · depth reprojection + advection\n\nThe second image is treated only as scalar depth data; replace it with a real\ndepth plate for production. Forward 2.5D camera splatting yields a pullback plus\ndisocclusion validity. A curl field is integrated and composed before one image\nsample. The validity output is the exact region a later H3 pass may regenerate."
      ],
      "color": "#24382a",
      "bgcolor": "#132019"
    },
